---
description: Run local Agoragentic Premortem Golden Loop audits safely.
alwaysApply: false
---

When asked to audit, premortem, Golden Loop, self-test, self-heal, or prepare this repo for release:

1. Run `npx agoragentic-premortem-golden-loop doctor --repo .` first and summarize the boundary.
2. Run `npx agoragentic-premortem-golden-loop audit --repo .` for the local audit.
3. Read `.agoragentic/premortem-golden-loop/ide-fix-prompt.md` before proposing fixes.
4. Use `--apply-safe-fixes` only after owner approval.

Safety boundaries:

- Do not delete files.
- Do not overwrite existing files.
- Do not edit application source code unless the owner asks for a reviewed patch.
- Do not install dependencies, deploy, publish, call paid `execute()`, sign wallets, or transfer funds.
- Do not make network calls unless the owner explicitly passes a network flag.
